Dialogue: 4,0:00:02.00,0:00:03.18,Caption,,0,0,0,,Bring every pain,
Dialogue: 4,0:00:03.18,0:00:04.53,Caption,,0,0,0,,of body or heart,
Dialogue: 4,0:00:04.53,0:00:05.72,Caption,,0,0,0,,to God tonight,
Dialogue: 4,0:00:05.72,0:00:07.31,Caption,,0,0,0,,and rest in his care
Dialogue: 4,0:00:07.31,0:00:08.94,Caption,,0,0,0,,while you sleep.
Dialogue: 4,0:00:09.57,0:00:11.40,Caption,,0,0,0,,If your body is hurting,
Dialogue: 4,0:00:11.40,0:00:12.70,Caption,,0,0,0,,or your heart is,
Dialogue: 4,0:00:12.70,0:00:14.60,Caption,,0,0,0,,stay with me for the next
Dialogue: 4,0:00:14.60,0:00:15.70,Caption,,0,0,0,,few minutes.
Dialogue: 4,0:00:15.70,0:00:18.38,Caption,,0,0,0,,Take one slow breath with me.
Dialogue: 4,0:00:18.38,0:00:20.31,Caption,,0,0,0,,Lie down and let the bed
Dialogue: 4,0:00:20.31,0:00:21.86,Caption,,0,0,0,,hold your weight.
Dialogue: 4,0:00:21.86,0:00:23.42,Caption,,0,0,0,,Let your hands rest,
Dialogue: 4,0:00:23.42,0:00:24.66,Caption,,0,0,0,,your jaw soften,
Dialogue: 4,0:00:24.66,0:00:26.39,Caption,,0,0,0,,your breathing slow.
Dialogue: 4,0:00:26.39,0:00:28.85,Caption,,0,0,0,,You may be tired of being sick,
Dialogue: 4,0:00:28.85,0:00:31.15,Caption,,0,0,0,,tired of waiting for results,
Dialogue: 4,0:00:31.15,0:00:33.32,Caption,,0,0,0,,tired of carrying sorrow.
Dialogue: 4,0:00:33.32,0:00:35.31,Caption,,0,0,0,,Bring all of it here.
Dialogue: 4,0:00:35.31,0:00:36.42,Caption,,0,0,0,,You do not have
Dialogue: 4,0:00:36.42,0:00:38.33,Caption,,0,0,0,,to be strong tonight.
Dialogue: 4,0:00:39.35,0:00:40.84,Caption,,0,0,0,,The prophet Jeremiah
Dialogue: 4,0:00:40.84,0:00:42.95,Caption,,0,0,0,,prayed this simple prayer.
Dialogue: 5,0:00:42.95,0:00:44.30,Verse,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,470)}Heal me, O LORD,
Dialogue: 5,0:00:44.30,0:00:46.35,Verse,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,470)}and I shall be healed;
Dialogue: 5,0:00:46.35,0:00:47.01,Verse,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,470)}save me,
Dialogue: 5,0:00:47.01,0:00:48.94,Verse,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,470)}and I shall be saved:
Dialogue: 5,0:00:48.94,0:00:51.57,Verse,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,470)}for thou art my praise.
Dialogue: 4,0:00:52.90,0:00:56.18,Caption,,0,0,0,,Jeremiah's prayer is short and honest.
Dialogue: 4,0:00:56.18,0:00:59.02,Caption,,0,0,0,,He does not explain or perform.
Dialogue: 4,0:00:59.02,0:01:00.93,Caption,,0,0,0,,He simply asks.
Dialogue: 4,0:01:00.93,0:01:03.78,Caption,,0,0,0,,Tonight you can pray the same way.
Dialogue: 4,0:01:03.78,0:01:06.52,Caption,,0,0,0,,You do not need the right words.
Dialogue: 4,0:01:06.52,0:01:08.00,Caption,,0,0,0,,You only need to bring
Dialogue: 4,0:01:08.00,0:01:10.37,Caption,,0,0,0,,yourself to the One who heals.
Dialogue: 4,0:01:11.40,0:01:13.30,Caption,,0,0,0,,So let us pray.
Dialogue: 4,0:01:13.30,0:01:13.70,Caption,,0,0,0,,Lord,
Dialogue: 4,0:01:13.70,0:01:15.28,Caption,,0,0,0,,here I am at the end
Dialogue: 4,0:01:15.28,0:01:16.22,Caption,,0,0,0,,of this day,
Dialogue: 4,0:01:16.22,0:01:18.19,Caption,,0,0,0,,with my body and my heart
Dialogue: 4,0:01:18.19,0:01:19.71,Caption,,0,0,0,,just as they are.
Dialogue: 4,0:01:19.71,0:01:21.37,Caption,,0,0,0,,You know every ache,
Dialogue: 4,0:01:21.37,0:01:22.53,Caption,,0,0,0,,every symptom,
Dialogue: 4,0:01:22.53,0:01:23.94,Caption,,0,0,0,,every fear I have
Dialogue: 4,0:01:23.94,0:01:25.61,Caption,,0,0,0,,not said out loud.
Dialogue: 4,0:01:25.61,0:01:27.73,Caption,,0,0,0,,Heal me, O Lord.
Dialogue: 4,0:01:27.73,0:01:29.68,Caption,,0,0,0,,Hold me tonight.
Dialogue: 4,0:01:30.71,0:01:33.16,Caption,,0,0,0,,He healeth the broken in heart,
Dialogue: 4,0:01:33.16,0:01:35.71,Caption,,0,0,0,,and bindeth up their wounds.
Dialogue: 4,0:01:37.04,0:01:39.47,Caption,,0,0,0,,The same psalm says God counts
Dialogue: 4,0:01:39.47,0:01:41.00,Caption,,0,0,0,,the stars and calls
Dialogue: 4,0:01:41.00,0:01:42.56,Caption,,0,0,0,,them all by name.
Dialogue: 4,0:01:42.56,0:01:44.24,Caption,,0,0,0,,And yet he bends down
Dialogue: 4,0:01:44.24,0:01:45.68,Caption,,0,0,0,,to bind up wounds,
Dialogue: 4,0:01:45.68,0:01:48.35,Caption,,0,0,0,,like a nurse tending a bandage.
Dialogue: 4,0:01:48.35,0:01:51.04,Caption,,0,0,0,,The God of the galaxies is gentle
Dialogue: 4,0:01:51.04,0:01:53.26,Caption,,0,0,0,,with your hurt tonight.
Dialogue: 4,0:01:54.29,0:01:56.92,Caption,,0,0,0,,Father, I bring you my body.
Dialogue: 4,0:01:56.92,0:01:58.45,Caption,,0,0,0,,Where there is pain,
Dialogue: 4,0:01:58.45,0:01:59.62,Caption,,0,0,0,,bring relief.
Dialogue: 4,0:01:59.62,0:02:01.81,Caption,,0,0,0,,Where there is inflammation,
Dialogue: 4,0:02:01.81,0:02:02.85,Caption,,0,0,0,,bring calm.
Dialogue: 4,0:02:02.85,0:02:04.50,Caption,,0,0,0,,Where there is sickness,
Dialogue: 4,0:02:04.50,0:02:06.40,Caption,,0,0,0,,bring your healing touch.
Dialogue: 4,0:02:06.40,0:02:08.70,Caption,,0,0,0,,Strengthen my immune system,
Dialogue: 4,0:02:08.70,0:02:10.00,Caption,,0,0,0,,steady my heart,
Dialogue: 4,0:02:10.00,0:02:12.56,Caption,,0,0,0,,and restore what is worn out.
Dialogue: 4,0:02:12.56,0:02:14.84,Caption,,0,0,0,,Let my body rest deeply tonight
Dialogue: 4,0:02:14.84,0:02:16.88,Caption,,0,0,0,,and heal while I sleep.
Dialogue: 5,0:02:17.90,0:02:19.84,Verse,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,470)}The LORD will strengthen him
Dialogue: 5,0:02:19.84,0:02:21.95,Verse,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,470)}upon the bed of languishing:
Dialogue: 5,0:02:21.95,0:02:23.37,Verse,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,470)}thou wilt make all
Dialogue: 5,0:02:23.37,0:02:25.62,Verse,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,470)}his bed in his sickness.
Dialogue: 4,0:02:26.96,0:02:28.38,Caption,,0,0,0,,Thou wilt make all
Dialogue: 4,0:02:28.38,0:02:30.46,Caption,,0,0,0,,his bed in his sickness.
Dialogue: 4,0:02:30.46,0:02:32.46,Caption,,0,0,0,,What a tender picture:
Dialogue: 4,0:02:32.46,0:02:34.89,Caption,,0,0,0,,God himself arranging the pillows,
Dialogue: 4,0:02:34.89,0:02:36.32,Caption,,0,0,0,,smoothing the sheets
Dialogue: 4,0:02:36.32,0:02:38.14,Caption,,0,0,0,,for the one who is ill.
Dialogue: 4,0:02:38.14,0:02:40.90,Caption,,0,0,0,,You are not forgotten in that bed.
Dialogue: 4,0:02:40.90,0:02:42.60,Caption,,0,0,0,,He is there.
Dialogue: 4,0:02:43.62,0:02:46.08,Caption,,0,0,0,,Lord, I thank you for doctors,
Dialogue: 4,0:02:46.08,0:02:46.66,Caption,,0,0,0,,nurses,
Dialogue: 4,0:02:46.66,0:02:48.70,Caption,,0,0,0,,medicine and every person
Dialogue: 4,0:02:48.70,0:02:50.93,Caption,,0,0,0,,whose work helps us heal.
Dialogue: 4,0:02:50.93,0:02:52.33,Caption,,0,0,0,,Give them wisdom,
Dialogue: 4,0:02:52.33,0:02:54.25,Caption,,0,0,0,,skill and compassion.
Dialogue: 4,0:02:54.25,0:02:57.46,Caption,,0,0,0,,Guide every decision about treatment.
Dialogue: 4,0:02:57.46,0:03:00.28,Caption,,0,0,0,,Let the medicine work as it should.
Dialogue: 4,0:03:00.28,0:03:02.22,Caption,,0,0,0,,And help me to keep following
Dialogue: 4,0:03:02.22,0:03:04.02,Caption,,0,0,0,,the care I have been given,
Dialogue: 4,0:03:04.02,0:03:06.43,Caption,,0,0,0,,trusting you through all of it.
Dialogue: 4,0:03:07.46,0:03:08.00,Caption,,0,0,0,,Father,
Dialogue: 4,0:03:08.00,0:03:10.47,Caption,,0,0,0,,for those living with an illness
Dialogue: 4,0:03:10.47,0:03:12.16,Caption,,0,0,0,,that does not go away,
Dialogue: 4,0:03:12.16,0:03:13.47,Caption,,0,0,0,,the chronic pain,
Dialogue: 4,0:03:13.47,0:03:15.01,Caption,,0,0,0,,the long treatments,
Dialogue: 4,0:03:15.01,0:03:17.94,Caption,,0,0,0,,the bodies that never quite feel well,
Dialogue: 4,0:03:17.94,0:03:19.27,Caption,,0,0,0,,give endurance.
Dialogue: 4,0:03:19.27,0:03:21.77,Caption,,0,0,0,,On the days when hope runs thin,
Dialogue: 4,0:03:21.77,0:03:22.65,Caption,,0,0,0,,renew it.
Dialogue: 4,0:03:22.65,0:03:24.42,Caption,,0,0,0,,Let them know that their
Dialogue: 4,0:03:24.42,0:03:26.18,Caption,,0,0,0,,worth is not measured by
Dialogue: 4,0:03:26.18,0:03:28.23,Caption,,0,0,0,,what their body can do.
Dialogue: 4,0:03:29.26,0:03:31.08,Caption,,0,0,0,,Let us be still.
Dialogue: 4,0:03:31.08,0:03:33.03,Caption,,0,0,0,,Breathe in slowly.
Dialogue: 4,0:03:33.03,0:03:34.70,Caption,,0,0,0,,And breathe out.
Dialogue: 4,0:03:34.70,0:03:36.47,Caption,,0,0,0,,Once more, breathe in,
Dialogue: 4,0:03:36.47,0:03:39.15,Caption,,0,0,0,,and let your body grow heavy.
Dialogue: 4,0:03:40.98,0:03:44.08,Caption,,0,0,0,,Healing is not only for the body.
Dialogue: 4,0:03:44.08,0:03:45.88,Caption,,0,0,0,,Let us bring the heart
Dialogue: 4,0:03:45.88,0:03:48.51,Caption,,0,0,0,,and the mind to God as well.
Dialogue: 4,0:03:49.84,0:03:50.44,Caption,,0,0,0,,Father,
Dialogue: 4,0:03:50.44,0:03:53.64,Caption,,0,0,0,,heal the broken places in my heart.
Dialogue: 4,0:03:53.64,0:03:56.11,Caption,,0,0,0,,The losses I still grieve.
Dialogue: 4,0:03:56.11,0:03:58.44,Caption,,0,0,0,,The words that wounded me.
Dialogue: 4,0:03:58.44,0:04:01.86,Caption,,0,0,0,,The disappointments I never got over.
Dialogue: 4,0:04:01.86,0:04:03.49,Caption,,0,0,0,,I do not have to hide
Dialogue: 4,0:04:03.49,0:04:04.75,Caption,,0,0,0,,them from you.
Dialogue: 4,0:04:04.75,0:04:07.02,Caption,,0,0,0,,Bind up these wounds, Lord,
Dialogue: 4,0:04:07.02,0:04:09.14,Caption,,0,0,0,,the way only you can.
Dialogue: 4,0:04:10.16,0:04:11.47,Caption,,0,0,0,,But he was wounded
Dialogue: 4,0:04:11.47,0:04:13.13,Caption,,0,0,0,,for our transgressions,
Dialogue: 4,0:04:13.13,0:04:15.76,Caption,,0,0,0,,he was bruised for our iniquities:
Dialogue: 4,0:04:15.76,0:04:17.80,Caption,,0,0,0,,the chastisement of our
Dialogue: 4,0:04:17.80,0:04:19.66,Caption,,0,0,0,,peace was upon him;
Dialogue: 4,0:04:19.66,0:04:22.40,Caption,,0,0,0,,and with his stripes we are healed.
Dialogue: 4,0:04:23.73,0:04:26.41,Caption,,0,0,0,,Before Jesus ever healed anyone,
Dialogue: 4,0:04:26.41,0:04:29.20,Caption,,0,0,0,,he chose to be wounded himself.
Dialogue: 4,0:04:29.20,0:04:31.83,Caption,,0,0,0,,He knows pain from the inside.
Dialogue: 4,0:04:31.83,0:04:33.24,Caption,,0,0,0,,So when you bring him
Dialogue: 4,0:04:33.24,0:04:34.45,Caption,,0,0,0,,your pain tonight,
Dialogue: 4,0:04:34.45,0:04:35.79,Caption,,0,0,0,,you are not bringing
Dialogue: 4,0:04:35.79,0:04:37.45,Caption,,0,0,0,,it to someone distant.
Dialogue: 4,0:04:37.45,0:04:38.79,Caption,,0,0,0,,You are bringing it
Dialogue: 4,0:04:38.79,0:04:41.04,Caption,,0,0,0,,to someone who understands.
Dialogue: 4,0:04:42.07,0:04:44.66,Caption,,0,0,0,,Lord, heal my anxious mind.
Dialogue: 4,0:04:44.66,0:04:47.89,Caption,,0,0,0,,Quiet the questions that run in circles.
Dialogue: 4,0:04:47.89,0:04:50.31,Caption,,0,0,0,,What if the results are bad?
Dialogue: 4,0:04:50.31,0:04:52.78,Caption,,0,0,0,,What if it does not get better?
Dialogue: 4,0:04:52.78,0:04:55.09,Caption,,0,0,0,,I give you every what if.
Dialogue: 4,0:04:55.09,0:04:57.62,Caption,,0,0,0,,Replace my fear with your peace,
Dialogue: 4,0:04:57.62,0:04:59.20,Caption,,0,0,0,,and let my mind rest
Dialogue: 4,0:04:59.20,0:05:00.73,Caption,,0,0,0,,in you tonight.
Dialogue: 4,0:05:01.76,0:05:02.14,Caption,,0,0,0,,Lord,
Dialogue: 4,0:05:02.14,0:05:03.73,Caption,,0,0,0,,I pray for every mind
Dialogue: 4,0:05:03.73,0:05:06.33,Caption,,0,0,0,,that is tired and heavy tonight.
Dialogue: 4,0:05:06.33,0:05:09.59,Caption,,0,0,0,,For depression that makes mornings hard.
Dialogue: 4,0:05:09.59,0:05:12.65,Caption,,0,0,0,,For anxiety that tightens the chest.
Dialogue: 4,0:05:12.65,0:05:14.26,Caption,,0,0,0,,For thoughts that feel
Dialogue: 4,0:05:14.26,0:05:16.28,Caption,,0,0,0,,too dark to say out loud.
Dialogue: 4,0:05:16.28,0:05:18.94,Caption,,0,0,0,,Bring light into those places.
Dialogue: 4,0:05:18.94,0:05:20.17,Caption,,0,0,0,,Lead each person
Dialogue: 4,0:05:20.17,0:05:21.86,Caption,,0,0,0,,to the help they need,
Dialogue: 4,0:05:21.86,0:05:23.94,Caption,,0,0,0,,the friend, the counsellor,
Dialogue: 4,0:05:23.94,0:05:24.78,Caption,,0,0,0,,the doctor,
Dialogue: 4,0:05:24.78,0:05:26.17,Caption,,0,0,0,,and let them never
Dialogue: 4,0:05:26.17,0:05:28.06,Caption,,0,0,0,,feel ashamed to ask.
Dialogue: 4,0:05:29.08,0:05:29.85,Caption,,0,0,0,,Be still,
Dialogue: 4,0:05:29.85,0:05:32.14,Caption,,0,0,0,,and know that I am God.
Dialogue: 4,0:05:33.48,0:05:34.81,Caption,,0,0,0,,Be still.
Dialogue: 4,0:05:34.81,0:05:37.31,Caption,,0,0,0,,Not because nothing is happening,
Dialogue: 4,0:05:37.31,0:05:39.50,Caption,,0,0,0,,but because God is still God,
Dialogue: 4,0:05:39.50,0:05:40.79,Caption,,0,0,0,,even in the dark,
Dialogue: 4,0:05:40.79,0:05:42.38,Caption,,0,0,0,,even in the hospital,
Dialogue: 4,0:05:42.38,0:05:44.08,Caption,,0,0,0,,even in the waiting.
Dialogue: 4,0:05:44.08,0:05:45.75,Caption,,0,0,0,,Your stillness tonight
Dialogue: 4,0:05:45.75,0:05:47.54,Caption,,0,0,0,,is an act of trust.
Dialogue: 5,0:05:48.57,0:05:51.50,Verse,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,470)}Have mercy upon me, O LORD;
Dialogue: 5,0:05:51.50,0:05:53.26,Verse,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,470)}for I am weak:
Dialogue: 5,0:05:53.26,0:05:55.21,Verse,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,470)}O LORD, heal me;
Dialogue: 4,0:05:55.21,0:05:57.76,Caption,,0,0,0,,for my bones are vexed.
Dialogue: 4,0:05:59.09,0:06:00.81,Caption,,0,0,0,,Father, like David,
Dialogue: 4,0:06:00.81,0:06:03.06,Caption,,0,0,0,,I admit that I am weak.
Dialogue: 4,0:06:03.06,0:06:04.17,Caption,,0,0,0,,I have run out
Dialogue: 4,0:06:04.17,0:06:05.85,Caption,,0,0,0,,of my own strength.
Dialogue: 4,0:06:05.85,0:06:07.88,Caption,,0,0,0,,Have mercy on me.
Dialogue: 4,0:06:07.88,0:06:10.05,Caption,,0,0,0,,Meet me in the weakness.
Dialogue: 4,0:06:10.05,0:06:12.14,Caption,,0,0,0,,Carry me where I cannot walk,
Dialogue: 4,0:06:12.14,0:06:13.88,Caption,,0,0,0,,and give me the strength
Dialogue: 4,0:06:13.88,0:06:15.45,Caption,,0,0,0,,to face tomorrow.
Dialogue: 4,0:06:16.48,0:06:19.03,Caption,,0,0,0,,For which cause we faint not;
Dialogue: 4,0:06:19.03,0:06:21.80,Caption,,0,0,0,,but though our outward man perish,
Dialogue: 4,0:06:21.80,0:06:23.26,Caption,,0,0,0,,yet the inward man
Dialogue: 4,0:06:23.26,0:06:25.40,Caption,,0,0,0,,is renewed day by day.
Dialogue: 4,0:06:26.73,0:06:29.08,Caption,,0,0,0,,Even when the body is struggling,
Dialogue: 4,0:06:29.08,0:06:31.54,Caption,,0,0,0,,something deeper can be renewed:
Dialogue: 4,0:06:31.54,0:06:33.14,Caption,,0,0,0,,your hope, your faith,
Dialogue: 4,0:06:33.14,0:06:35.52,Caption,,0,0,0,,your sense that you are loved.
Dialogue: 4,0:06:35.52,0:06:37.69,Caption,,0,0,0,,God is at work on the inside
Dialogue: 4,0:06:37.69,0:06:38.85,Caption,,0,0,0,,of you tonight,
Dialogue: 4,0:06:38.85,0:06:41.69,Caption,,0,0,0,,whatever the outside feels like.
Dialogue: 4,0:06:42.72,0:06:43.09,Caption,,0,0,0,,Lord,
Dialogue: 4,0:06:43.09,0:06:45.22,Caption,,0,0,0,,I pray for everyone who cares
Dialogue: 4,0:06:45.22,0:06:47.16,Caption,,0,0,0,,for someone who is sick.
Dialogue: 4,0:06:47.16,0:06:50.10,Caption,,0,0,0,,The parents beside a child's bed.
Dialogue: 4,0:06:50.10,0:06:52.16,Caption,,0,0,0,,The husband or wife who has
Dialogue: 4,0:06:52.16,0:06:54.18,Caption,,0,0,0,,not slept well in weeks.
Dialogue: 4,0:06:54.18,0:06:57.30,Caption,,0,0,0,,The children caring for aging parents.
Dialogue: 4,0:06:57.30,0:06:58.76,Caption,,0,0,0,,Give them strength,
Dialogue: 4,0:06:58.76,0:07:00.32,Caption,,0,0,0,,patience and rest.
Dialogue: 4,0:07:00.32,0:07:02.38,Caption,,0,0,0,,Let them know that what they do
Dialogue: 4,0:07:02.38,0:07:04.66,Caption,,0,0,0,,is seen and treasured by you.
Dialogue: 4,0:07:05.69,0:07:06.23,Caption,,0,0,0,,Father,
Dialogue: 4,0:07:06.23,0:07:08.90,Caption,,0,0,0,,I lift up every sick child tonight,
Dialogue: 4,0:07:08.90,0:07:10.12,Caption,,0,0,0,,and every parent
Dialogue: 4,0:07:10.12,0:07:12.06,Caption,,0,0,0,,who is afraid for them.
Dialogue: 4,0:07:12.06,0:07:14.42,Caption,,0,0,0,,Hold these little ones close.
Dialogue: 4,0:07:14.42,0:07:15.64,Caption,,0,0,0,,Ease their fever,
Dialogue: 4,0:07:15.64,0:07:16.80,Caption,,0,0,0,,calm their fear,
Dialogue: 4,0:07:16.80,0:07:18.17,Caption,,0,0,0,,and bring them back
Dialogue: 4,0:07:18.17,0:07:20.08,Caption,,0,0,0,,to playing and laughing.
Dialogue: 4,0:07:20.08,0:07:22.94,Caption,,0,0,0,,Give their parents peace and sleep.
Dialogue: 4,0:07:23.98,0:07:24.51,Caption,,0,0,0,,Father,
Dialogue: 4,0:07:24.51,0:07:26.58,Caption,,0,0,0,,I lift up the people I know
Dialogue: 4,0:07:26.58,0:07:28.29,Caption,,0,0,0,,who are ill tonight.
Dialogue: 4,0:07:28.29,0:07:30.79,Caption,,0,0,0,,I bring their names to you now,
Dialogue: 4,0:07:30.79,0:07:31.61,Caption,,0,0,0,,quietly.
Dialogue: 4,0:07:31.61,0:07:33.11,Caption,,0,0,0,,Heal them.
Dialogue: 4,0:07:33.11,0:07:34.68,Caption,,0,0,0,,Comfort them.
Dialogue: 4,0:07:34.68,0:07:37.42,Caption,,0,0,0,,Surround them with people who love them,
Dialogue: 4,0:07:37.42,0:07:39.55,Caption,,0,0,0,,and let them feel your presence
Dialogue: 4,0:07:39.55,0:07:42.03,Caption,,0,0,0,,in the long hours of the night.
Dialogue: 4,0:07:43.06,0:07:43.44,Caption,,0,0,0,,Lord,
Dialogue: 4,0:07:43.44,0:07:45.71,Caption,,0,0,0,,if bitterness or unforgiveness
Dialogue: 4,0:07:45.71,0:07:47.08,Caption,,0,0,0,,is weighing on me,
Dialogue: 4,0:07:47.08,0:07:49.23,Caption,,0,0,0,,I bring it to you as well.
Dialogue: 4,0:07:49.23,0:07:50.87,Caption,,0,0,0,,Some wounds stay open
Dialogue: 4,0:07:50.87,0:07:53.23,Caption,,0,0,0,,because I keep holding them.
Dialogue: 4,0:07:53.23,0:07:54.62,Caption,,0,0,0,,Help me to forgive,
Dialogue: 4,0:07:54.62,0:07:56.95,Caption,,0,0,0,,and to receive your forgiveness,
Dialogue: 4,0:07:56.95,0:07:58.41,Caption,,0,0,0,,so that my heart can
Dialogue: 4,0:07:58.41,0:08:00.00,Caption,,0,0,0,,heal tonight too.
Dialogue: 5,0:08:01.03,0:08:02.18,Verse,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,470)}O LORD my God,
Dialogue: 5,0:08:02.18,0:08:03.65,Verse,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,470)}I cried unto thee,
Dialogue: 5,0:08:03.65,0:08:05.97,Verse,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,470)}and thou hast healed me.
Dialogue: 5,0:08:07.30,0:08:09.40,Verse,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,470)}Bless the LORD, O my soul,
Dialogue: 5,0:08:09.40,0:08:12.17,Verse,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,470)}and forget not all his benefits:
Dialogue: 5,0:08:12.17,0:08:14.98,Verse,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,470)}Who forgiveth all thine iniquities;
Dialogue: 5,0:08:14.98,0:08:17.99,Verse,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,470)}who healeth all thy diseases.
Dialogue: 4,0:08:19.32,0:08:20.58,Caption,,0,0,0,,Thank you, Lord,
Dialogue: 4,0:08:20.58,0:08:22.48,Caption,,0,0,0,,for every healing I have
Dialogue: 4,0:08:22.48,0:08:24.00,Caption,,0,0,0,,already received.
Dialogue: 4,0:08:24.00,0:08:26.32,Caption,,0,0,0,,The sicknesses that passed.
Dialogue: 4,0:08:26.32,0:08:28.52,Caption,,0,0,0,,The wounds that closed.
Dialogue: 4,0:08:28.52,0:08:30.86,Caption,,0,0,0,,The sorrows that lifted.
Dialogue: 4,0:08:30.86,0:08:33.53,Caption,,0,0,0,,I will not forget your benefits.
Dialogue: 4,0:08:33.53,0:08:35.22,Caption,,0,0,0,,You have been good to me,
Dialogue: 4,0:08:35.22,0:08:36.96,Caption,,0,0,0,,and I trust you to be good
Dialogue: 4,0:08:36.96,0:08:38.26,Caption,,0,0,0,,to me tonight.
Dialogue: 4,0:08:39.29,0:08:39.84,Caption,,0,0,0,,Father,
Dialogue: 4,0:08:39.84,0:08:41.34,Caption,,0,0,0,,I pray for everyone
Dialogue: 4,0:08:41.34,0:08:43.56,Caption,,0,0,0,,in a hospital bed tonight.
Dialogue: 4,0:08:43.56,0:08:46.01,Caption,,0,0,0,,For those waiting for surgery,
Dialogue: 4,0:08:46.01,0:08:47.16,Caption,,0,0,0,,those in pain,
Dialogue: 4,0:08:47.16,0:08:48.79,Caption,,0,0,0,,those far from home,
Dialogue: 4,0:08:48.79,0:08:49.77,Caption,,0,0,0,,those afraid
Dialogue: 4,0:08:49.77,0:08:52.32,Caption,,0,0,0,,of what the doctors will say.
Dialogue: 4,0:08:52.32,0:08:54.63,Caption,,0,0,0,,Sit beside each of them.
Dialogue: 4,0:08:54.63,0:08:57.26,Caption,,0,0,0,,Let the beeping machines and the long
Dialogue: 4,0:08:57.26,0:09:00.17,Caption,,0,0,0,,corridors be filled with your peace.
Dialogue: 4,0:09:01.20,0:09:03.20,Caption,,0,0,0,,And Lord, bless the nurses,
Dialogue: 4,0:09:03.20,0:09:05.14,Caption,,0,0,0,,doctors and carers working
Dialogue: 4,0:09:05.14,0:09:06.73,Caption,,0,0,0,,through this night.
Dialogue: 4,0:09:06.73,0:09:09.66,Caption,,0,0,0,,Keep them alert, kind and safe.
Dialogue: 4,0:09:09.66,0:09:11.80,Caption,,0,0,0,,Let their hands bring comfort,
Dialogue: 4,0:09:11.80,0:09:13.29,Caption,,0,0,0,,and refresh them when
Dialogue: 4,0:09:13.29,0:09:15.07,Caption,,0,0,0,,their shift is over.
Dialogue: 4,0:09:16.10,0:09:16.94,Caption,,0,0,0,,And Father,
Dialogue: 4,0:09:16.94,0:09:19.60,Caption,,0,0,0,,for anyone who is grieving tonight,
Dialogue: 4,0:09:19.60,0:09:21.27,Caption,,0,0,0,,especially for someone
Dialogue: 4,0:09:21.27,0:09:22.79,Caption,,0,0,0,,they could not save,
Dialogue: 4,0:09:22.79,0:09:24.19,Caption,,0,0,0,,hold them close.
Dialogue: 4,0:09:24.19,0:09:26.29,Caption,,0,0,0,,Heal the ache of loss.
Dialogue: 4,0:09:26.29,0:09:28.25,Caption,,0,0,0,,Let them weep without shame,
Dialogue: 4,0:09:28.25,0:09:29.44,Caption,,0,0,0,,and let them feel
Dialogue: 4,0:09:29.44,0:09:31.96,Caption,,0,0,0,,that you are weeping with them.
Dialogue: 5,0:09:32.98,0:09:34.78,Verse,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,470)}And God shall wipe away
Dialogue: 5,0:09:34.78,0:09:36.98,Verse,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,470)}all tears from their eyes;
Dialogue: 5,0:09:36.98,0:09:39.42,Verse,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,470)}and there shall be no more death,
Dialogue: 5,0:09:39.42,0:09:41.42,Verse,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,470)}neither sorrow, nor crying,
Dialogue: 5,0:09:41.42,0:09:44.33,Verse,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,470)}neither shall there be any more pain:
Dialogue: 4,0:09:44.33,0:09:47.48,Caption,,0,0,0,,for the former things are passed away.
Dialogue: 4,0:09:48.81,0:09:50.85,Caption,,0,0,0,,This is the promise beneath
Dialogue: 4,0:09:50.85,0:09:52.55,Caption,,0,0,0,,every other promise.
Dialogue: 4,0:09:52.55,0:09:54.55,Caption,,0,0,0,,One day God himself will
Dialogue: 4,0:09:54.55,0:09:56.48,Caption,,0,0,0,,wipe away every tear.
Dialogue: 4,0:09:56.48,0:09:59.29,Caption,,0,0,0,,Pain will not have the last word.
Dialogue: 4,0:09:59.29,0:10:01.97,Caption,,0,0,0,,Whatever healing you receive tonight
Dialogue: 4,0:10:01.97,0:10:04.48,Caption,,0,0,0,,is a small taste of that day.
Dialogue: 4,0:10:05.51,0:10:06.66,Caption,,0,0,0,,O Lord my God,
Dialogue: 4,0:10:06.66,0:10:08.13,Caption,,0,0,0,,I cried unto thee,
Dialogue: 4,0:10:08.13,0:10:10.28,Caption,,0,0,0,,and thou hast healed me.
Dialogue: 4,0:10:10.28,0:10:12.32,Caption,,0,0,0,,David wrote that looking back
Dialogue: 4,0:10:12.32,0:10:14.00,Caption,,0,0,0,,on a night he thought he
Dialogue: 4,0:10:14.00,0:10:15.45,Caption,,0,0,0,,would not survive.
Dialogue: 4,0:10:15.45,0:10:16.83,Caption,,0,0,0,,One day you may look
Dialogue: 4,0:10:16.83,0:10:18.42,Caption,,0,0,0,,back on this night too,
Dialogue: 4,0:10:18.42,0:10:20.00,Caption,,0,0,0,,and see how God carried
Dialogue: 4,0:10:20.00,0:10:21.39,Caption,,0,0,0,,you through it.
Dialogue: 4,0:10:22.42,0:10:24.36,Caption,,0,0,0,,And we know that all things
Dialogue: 4,0:10:24.36,0:10:25.93,Caption,,0,0,0,,work together for good
Dialogue: 4,0:10:25.93,0:10:27.51,Caption,,0,0,0,,to them that love God,
Dialogue: 4,0:10:27.51,0:10:29.37,Caption,,0,0,0,,to them who are the called
Dialogue: 4,0:10:29.37,0:10:31.52,Caption,,0,0,0,,according to his purpose.
Dialogue: 4,0:10:32.84,0:10:33.22,Caption,,0,0,0,,Lord,
Dialogue: 4,0:10:33.22,0:10:35.50,Caption,,0,0,0,,I do not understand everything
Dialogue: 4,0:10:35.50,0:10:37.12,Caption,,0,0,0,,I am going through.
Dialogue: 4,0:10:37.12,0:10:38.84,Caption,,0,0,0,,But I choose to trust
Dialogue: 4,0:10:38.84,0:10:40.56,Caption,,0,0,0,,that you are working,
Dialogue: 4,0:10:40.56,0:10:42.38,Caption,,0,0,0,,even here, even now.
Dialogue: 4,0:10:42.38,0:10:44.09,Caption,,0,0,0,,Help me to wait with hope,
Dialogue: 4,0:10:44.09,0:10:46.07,Caption,,0,0,0,,and to see your goodness again
Dialogue: 4,0:10:46.07,0:10:48.13,Caption,,0,0,0,,in the land of the living.
Dialogue: 4,0:10:49.16,0:10:49.72,Caption,,0,0,0,,Father,
Dialogue: 4,0:10:49.72,0:10:52.00,Caption,,0,0,0,,give me hope for tomorrow.
Dialogue: 4,0:10:52.00,0:10:53.91,Caption,,0,0,0,,Not a forced cheerfulness,
Dialogue: 4,0:10:53.91,0:10:55.53,Caption,,0,0,0,,but a quiet confidence
Dialogue: 4,0:10:55.53,0:10:57.07,Caption,,0,0,0,,that you are with me,
Dialogue: 4,0:10:57.07,0:10:59.31,Caption,,0,0,0,,whatever the morning brings.
Dialogue: 4,0:10:59.31,0:11:01.47,Caption,,0,0,0,,Let me wake with new strength,
Dialogue: 4,0:11:01.47,0:11:03.21,Caption,,0,0,0,,and see your mercy again
Dialogue: 4,0:11:03.21,0:11:04.93,Caption,,0,0,0,,when the sun rises.
Dialogue: 4,0:11:05.96,0:11:08.66,Caption,,0,0,0,,And now, Lord, give me sleep.
Dialogue: 4,0:11:08.66,0:11:09.06,Caption,,0,0,0,,Deep,
Dialogue: 4,0:11:09.06,0:11:11.10,Caption,,0,0,0,,restoring sleep that lets
Dialogue: 4,0:11:11.10,0:11:13.30,Caption,,0,0,0,,my body do the healing work
Dialogue: 4,0:11:13.30,0:11:15.28,Caption,,0,0,0,,you designed it to do.
Dialogue: 4,0:11:15.28,0:11:16.64,Caption,,0,0,0,,If pain wakes me,
Dialogue: 4,0:11:16.64,0:11:18.89,Caption,,0,0,0,,let me feel your nearness.
Dialogue: 4,0:11:18.89,0:11:20.25,Caption,,0,0,0,,If fear wakes me,
Dialogue: 4,0:11:20.25,0:11:22.27,Caption,,0,0,0,,let me hear your peace.
Dialogue: 4,0:11:22.27,0:11:23.97,Caption,,0,0,0,,And let me fall asleep
Dialogue: 4,0:11:23.97,0:11:25.78,Caption,,0,0,0,,again in your arms.
Dialogue: 4,0:11:26.81,0:11:28.46,Caption,,0,0,0,,I surrender my body,
Dialogue: 4,0:11:28.46,0:11:30.28,Caption,,0,0,0,,my heart and my future
Dialogue: 4,0:11:30.28,0:11:31.70,Caption,,0,0,0,,to you tonight.
Dialogue: 4,0:11:31.70,0:11:33.28,Caption,,0,0,0,,I do not have to hold
Dialogue: 4,0:11:33.28,0:11:34.96,Caption,,0,0,0,,everything together.
Dialogue: 4,0:11:34.96,0:11:36.52,Caption,,0,0,0,,You hold me.
Dialogue: 4,0:11:36.52,0:11:39.54,Caption,,0,0,0,,Into your hands I commit my spirit,
Dialogue: 4,0:11:39.54,0:11:40.76,Caption,,0,0,0,,as I rest.
Dialogue: 4,0:11:41.78,0:11:44.18,Caption,,0,0,0,,Breathe in again, slowly.
Dialogue: 4,0:11:44.18,0:11:45.92,Caption,,0,0,0,,And let it out.
Dialogue: 4,0:11:45.92,0:11:48.30,Caption,,0,0,0,,Let every muscle relax.
Dialogue: 4,0:11:48.30,0:11:50.46,Caption,,0,0,0,,Let God hold you.
Dialogue: 4,0:11:52.29,0:11:54.90,Caption,,0,0,0,,Say these words with me quietly,
Dialogue: 4,0:11:54.90,0:11:56.06,Caption,,0,0,0,,as you rest.
Dialogue: 4,0:11:56.06,0:11:58.30,Caption,,0,0,0,,The Lord is my healer.
Dialogue: 4,0:11:58.30,0:12:00.66,Caption,,0,0,0,,He binds up my wounds.
Dialogue: 4,0:12:00.66,0:12:03.32,Caption,,0,0,0,,I am not alone in this bed.
Dialogue: 4,0:12:03.32,0:12:04.01,Caption,,0,0,0,,My body,
Dialogue: 4,0:12:04.01,0:12:05.76,Caption,,0,0,0,,my heart and my mind
Dialogue: 4,0:12:05.76,0:12:07.42,Caption,,0,0,0,,are in his hands.
Dialogue: 4,0:12:07.42,0:12:08.93,Caption,,0,0,0,,I will rest tonight,
Dialogue: 4,0:12:08.93,0:12:10.86,Caption,,0,0,0,,and he will renew me.
Dialogue: 4,0:12:12.20,0:12:14.70,Caption,,0,0,0,,I laid me down and slept;
Dialogue: 4,0:12:14.70,0:12:16.22,Caption,,0,0,0,,I awaked;
Dialogue: 5,0:12:16.22,0:12:18.77,Verse,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,470)}for the LORD sustained me.
Dialogue: 4,0:12:20.10,0:12:22.61,Caption,,0,0,0,,I laid me down and slept;
Dialogue: 4,0:12:22.61,0:12:24.13,Caption,,0,0,0,,I awaked;
Dialogue: 4,0:12:24.13,0:12:26.51,Caption,,0,0,0,,for the Lord sustained me.
Dialogue: 4,0:12:26.51,0:12:29.52,Caption,,0,0,0,,Sleep itself is an act of trust.
Dialogue: 4,0:12:29.52,0:12:31.84,Caption,,0,0,0,,You let go of control for hours,
Dialogue: 4,0:12:31.84,0:12:34.16,Caption,,0,0,0,,and God keeps your heart beating
Dialogue: 4,0:12:34.16,0:12:36.15,Caption,,0,0,0,,and your lungs breathing.
Dialogue: 4,0:12:36.15,0:12:36.76,Caption,,0,0,0,,Tonight,
Dialogue: 4,0:12:36.76,0:12:39.10,Caption,,0,0,0,,he will sustain you again.
Dialogue: 4,0:12:40.13,0:12:42.98,Caption,,0,0,0,,Here is one thing to do tonight.
Dialogue: 4,0:12:42.98,0:12:45.23,Caption,,0,0,0,,Place your hand where it hurts,
Dialogue: 4,0:12:45.23,0:12:46.61,Caption,,0,0,0,,or over your heart,
Dialogue: 4,0:12:46.61,0:12:48.68,Caption,,0,0,0,,and pray just three words:
Dialogue: 4,0:12:48.68,0:12:50.42,Caption,,0,0,0,,Lord, heal me.
Dialogue: 4,0:12:50.42,0:12:52.07,Caption,,0,0,0,,Then leave it with him,
Dialogue: 4,0:12:52.07,0:12:54.08,Caption,,0,0,0,,and let yourself sleep.
Dialogue: 4,0:12:55.11,0:12:57.07,Caption,,0,0,0,,If you prayed this prayer,
Dialogue: 4,0:12:57.07,0:12:59.33,Caption,,0,0,0,,type amen in the comments now,
Dialogue: 4,0:12:59.33,0:13:00.54,Caption,,0,0,0,,and if you want,
Dialogue: 4,0:13:00.54,0:13:02.42,Caption,,0,0,0,,share the name of someone
Dialogue: 4,0:13:02.42,0:13:03.78,Caption,,0,0,0,,who needs healing,
Dialogue: 4,0:13:03.78,0:13:05.70,Caption,,0,0,0,,so others can pray too.
Dialogue: 4,0:13:05.70,0:13:08.24,Caption,,0,0,0,,Then stay right where you are.
Dialogue: 4,0:13:08.24,0:13:10.19,Caption,,0,0,0,,For the rest of this time,
Dialogue: 4,0:13:10.19,0:13:11.62,Caption,,0,0,0,,I will read healing
Dialogue: 4,0:13:11.62,0:13:13.57,Caption,,0,0,0,,Scripture over you slowly,
Dialogue: 4,0:13:13.57,0:13:14.69,Caption,,0,0,0,,so you can fall
Dialogue: 4,0:13:14.69,0:13:16.62,Caption,,0,0,0,,asleep in God's care.
Dialogue: 4,0:13:18.45,0:13:20.36,Caption,,0,0,0,,Let us begin by letting
Dialogue: 4,0:13:20.36,0:13:21.96,Caption,,0,0,0,,your body settle.
Dialogue: 4,0:13:21.96,0:13:23.40,Caption,,0,0,0,,Breathe in gently,
Dialogue: 4,0:13:23.40,0:13:26.28,Caption,,0,0,0,,as deeply as is comfortable for you,
Dialogue: 4,0:13:26.28,0:13:28.79,Caption,,0,0,0,,and let the breath go slowly.
Dialogue: 4,0:13:28.79,0:13:30.19,Caption,,0,0,0,,If there is pain,
Dialogue: 4,0:13:30.19,0:13:31.68,Caption,,0,0,0,,do not fight it.
Dialogue: 4,0:13:31.68,0:13:32.91,Caption,,0,0,0,,Just notice it,
Dialogue: 4,0:13:32.91,0:13:35.38,Caption,,0,0,0,,and place it in God's hands.
Dialogue: 4,0:13:35.38,0:13:37.50,Caption,,0,0,0,,Let your face soften.
Dialogue: 4,0:13:37.50,0:13:39.79,Caption,,0,0,0,,Let your eyes close.
Dialogue: 4,0:13:40.82,0:13:43.01,Caption,,0,0,0,,Let your shoulders drop.
Dialogue: 4,0:13:43.01,0:13:44.43,Caption,,0,0,0,,Let your arms rest
Dialogue: 4,0:13:44.43,0:13:46.20,Caption,,0,0,0,,heavy at your sides.
Dialogue: 4,0:13:46.20,0:13:48.30,Caption,,0,0,0,,Let your hands open.
Dialogue: 4,0:13:48.30,0:13:50.45,Caption,,0,0,0,,Feel the mattress holding you,
Dialogue: 4,0:13:50.45,0:13:52.94,Caption,,0,0,0,,the pillow supporting your head.
Dialogue: 4,0:13:52.94,0:13:54.68,Caption,,0,0,0,,You do not have to hold
Dialogue: 4,0:13:54.68,0:13:56.38,Caption,,0,0,0,,yourself up tonight.
Dialogue: 4,0:13:56.38,0:13:58.16,Caption,,0,0,0,,You are held.
Dialogue: 4,0:13:59.19,0:14:01.35,Caption,,0,0,0,,Let the warmth of rest spread
Dialogue: 4,0:14:01.35,0:14:03.29,Caption,,0,0,0,,slowly through your chest,
Dialogue: 4,0:14:03.29,0:14:05.08,Caption,,0,0,0,,your stomach, your hips,
Dialogue: 4,0:14:05.08,0:14:05.83,Caption,,0,0,0,,your legs,
Dialogue: 4,0:14:05.83,0:14:08.24,Caption,,0,0,0,,all the way down to your feet.
Dialogue: 4,0:14:08.24,0:14:10.32,Caption,,0,0,0,,Every part of you is known
Dialogue: 4,0:14:10.32,0:14:12.41,Caption,,0,0,0,,by the God who made you.
Dialogue: 4,0:14:12.41,0:14:14.79,Caption,,0,0,0,,Every cell is in his care.
Dialogue: 4,0:14:14.79,0:14:16.46,Caption,,0,0,0,,Rest now.
Dialogue: 4,0:14:17.49,0:14:20.04,Caption,,0,0,0,,Now let the day itself go.
Dialogue: 4,0:14:20.04,0:14:21.21,Caption,,0,0,0,,The appointments,
Dialogue: 4,0:14:21.21,0:14:22.31,Caption,,0,0,0,,the phone calls,
Dialogue: 4,0:14:22.31,0:14:24.49,Caption,,0,0,0,,the waiting rooms, the worry.
Dialogue: 4,0:14:24.49,0:14:26.37,Caption,,0,0,0,,Let each one drift away
Dialogue: 4,0:14:26.37,0:14:28.68,Caption,,0,0,0,,like a leaf on slow water.
Dialogue: 4,0:14:28.68,0:14:30.19,Caption,,0,0,0,,There is nothing more
Dialogue: 4,0:14:30.19,0:14:31.89,Caption,,0,0,0,,you need to do today.
Dialogue: 4,0:14:31.89,0:14:32.56,Caption,,0,0,0,,Tonight,
Dialogue: 4,0:14:32.56,0:14:35.12,Caption,,0,0,0,,your only task is to rest.
Dialogue: 4,0:14:36.15,0:14:37.57,Caption,,0,0,0,,Listen to this psalm
Dialogue: 4,0:14:37.57,0:14:39.25,Caption,,0,0,0,,of healing and mercy.
Dialogue: 5,0:14:39.25,0:14:41.76,Verse,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,470)}Bless the LORD, O my soul:
Dialogue: 5,0:14:41.76,0:14:43.82,Verse,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,470)}and all that is within me,
Dialogue: 5,0:14:43.82,0:14:45.58,Verse,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,470)}bless his holy name.
Dialogue: 5,0:14:45.58,0:14:47.69,Verse,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,470)}Bless the LORD, O my soul,
Dialogue: 5,0:14:47.69,0:14:50.46,Verse,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,470)}and forget not all his benefits:
Dialogue: 5,0:14:50.46,0:14:53.26,Verse,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,470)}Who forgiveth all thine iniquities;
Dialogue: 5,0:14:53.26,0:14:56.13,Verse,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,470)}who healeth all thy diseases;
Dialogue: 5,0:14:56.13,0:14:59.38,Verse,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,470)}Who redeemeth thy life from destruction;
Dialogue: 5,0:14:59.38,0:15:02.13,Verse,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,470)}who crowneth thee with lovingkindness
Dialogue: 5,0:15:02.13,0:15:03.72,Verse,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,470)}and tender mercies;
Dialogue: 5,0:15:03.72,0:15:05.13,Verse,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,470)}Who satisfieth thy
Dialogue: 5,0:15:05.13,0:15:07.12,Verse,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,470)}mouth with good things;
Dialogue: 5,0:15:07.12,0:15:09.28,Verse,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,470)}so that thy youth is renewed
Dialogue: 5,0:15:09.28,0:15:10.78,Verse,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,470)}like the eagle's.
Dialogue: 5,0:15:10.78,0:15:13.67,Verse,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,470)}The LORD is merciful and gracious,
Dialogue: 5,0:15:13.67,0:15:14.86,Verse,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,470)}slow to anger,
Dialogue: 5,0:15:14.86,0:15:17.00,Verse,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,470)}and plenteous in mercy.
Dialogue: 5,0:15:17.00,0:15:19.40,Verse,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,470)}He will not always chide:
Dialogue: 5,0:15:19.40,0:15:20.97,Verse,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,470)}neither will he keep
Dialogue: 5,0:15:20.97,0:15:22.65,Verse,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,470)}his anger for ever.
Dialogue: 5,0:15:22.65,0:15:24.00,Verse,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,470)}He hath not dealt
Dialogue: 5,0:15:24.00,0:15:26.00,Verse,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,470)}with us after our sins;
Dialogue: 5,0:15:26.00,0:15:28.06,Verse,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,470)}nor rewarded us according
Dialogue: 5,0:15:28.06,0:15:29.73,Verse,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,470)}to our iniquities.
Dialogue: 5,0:15:29.73,0:15:31.06,Verse,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,470)}For as the heaven
Dialogue: 5,0:15:31.06,0:15:32.95,Verse,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,470)}is high above the earth,
Dialogue: 5,0:15:32.95,0:15:34.60,Verse,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,470)}so great is his mercy
Dialogue: 5,0:15:34.60,0:15:36.82,Verse,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,470)}toward them that fear him.
Dialogue: 5,0:15:36.82,0:15:38.20,Verse,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,470)}As far as the east
Dialogue: 5,0:15:38.20,0:15:39.49,Verse,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,470)}is from the west,
Dialogue: 5,0:15:39.49,0:15:41.48,Verse,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,470)}so far hath he removed our
Dialogue: 5,0:15:41.48,0:15:43.42,Verse,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,470)}transgressions from us.
Dialogue: 5,0:15:43.42,0:15:46.29,Verse,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,470)}Like as a father pitieth his children,
Dialogue: 5,0:15:46.29,0:15:47.72,Verse,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,470)}so the LORD pitieth
Dialogue: 5,0:15:47.72,0:15:49.51,Verse,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,470)}them that fear him.
Dialogue: 4,0:15:50.54,0:15:53.66,Caption,,0,0,0,,Like as a father pitieth his children.
Dialogue: 4,0:15:53.66,0:15:56.03,Caption,,0,0,0,,Think of a loving father sitting
Dialogue: 4,0:15:56.03,0:15:58.61,Caption,,0,0,0,,beside a sick child's bed at night,
Dialogue: 4,0:15:58.61,0:16:00.71,Caption,,0,0,0,,watching, caring, staying.
Dialogue: 4,0:16:00.71,0:16:01.90,Caption,,0,0,0,,That is how God
Dialogue: 4,0:16:01.90,0:16:03.84,Caption,,0,0,0,,is with you tonight.
Dialogue: 5,0:16:04.86,0:16:07.05,Verse,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,470)}The LORD is my shepherd;
Dialogue: 5,0:16:07.05,0:16:08.94,Verse,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,470)}I shall not want.
Dialogue: 5,0:16:08.94,0:16:10.51,Verse,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,470)}He maketh me to lie
Dialogue: 5,0:16:10.51,0:16:12.60,Verse,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,470)}down in green pastures:
Dialogue: 5,0:16:12.60,0:16:15.78,Verse,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,470)}he leadeth me beside the still waters.
Dialogue: 5,0:16:15.78,0:16:18.10,Verse,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,470)}He restoreth my soul:
Dialogue: 5,0:16:18.10,0:16:20.14,Verse,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,470)}he leadeth me in the paths
Dialogue: 5,0:16:20.14,0:16:23.22,Verse,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,470)}of righteousness for his name's sake.
Dialogue: 5,0:16:23.22,0:16:23.52,Verse,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,470)}Yea,
Dialogue: 5,0:16:23.52,0:16:25.84,Verse,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,470)}though I walk through the valley
Dialogue: 5,0:16:25.84,0:16:27.51,Verse,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,470)}of the shadow of death,
Dialogue: 5,0:16:27.51,0:16:29.14,Verse,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,470)}I will fear no evil:
Dialogue: 5,0:16:29.14,0:16:31.42,Verse,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,470)}for thou art with me;
Dialogue: 5,0:16:31.42,0:16:33.17,Verse,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,470)}thy rod and thy staff
Dialogue: 5,0:16:33.17,0:16:34.69,Verse,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,470)}they comfort me.
Dialogue: 5,0:16:34.69,0:16:37.28,Verse,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,470)}Thou preparest a table before me
Dialogue: 5,0:16:37.28,0:16:40.05,Verse,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,470)}in the presence of mine enemies:
Dialogue: 5,0:16:40.05,0:16:42.94,Verse,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,470)}thou anointest my head with oil;
Dialogue: 5,0:16:42.94,0:16:45.00,Verse,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,470)}my cup runneth over.
Dialogue: 5,0:16:45.00,0:16:47.54,Verse,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,470)}Surely goodness and mercy shall
Dialogue: 5,0:16:47.54,0:16:48.94,Verse,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,470)}follow me all the
Dialogue: 5,0:16:48.94,0:16:50.43,Verse,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,470)}days of my life:
Dialogue: 5,0:16:50.43,0:16:52.56,Verse,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,470)}and I will dwell in the house
Dialogue: 5,0:16:52.56,0:16:54.45,Verse,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,470)}of the LORD for ever.
Dialogue: 4,0:16:55.48,0:16:57.77,Caption,,0,0,0,,He restoreth my soul.
Dialogue: 4,0:16:57.77,0:17:00.20,Caption,,0,0,0,,Restoring is slow, quiet work,
Dialogue: 4,0:17:00.20,0:17:01.75,Caption,,0,0,0,,the kind that often
Dialogue: 4,0:17:01.75,0:17:03.79,Caption,,0,0,0,,happens while we sleep.
Dialogue: 4,0:17:03.79,0:17:06.08,Caption,,0,0,0,,Let the shepherd do his restoring
Dialogue: 4,0:17:06.08,0:17:07.81,Caption,,0,0,0,,work in you tonight.
Dialogue: 4,0:17:08.84,0:17:11.38,Caption,,0,0,0,,God is our refuge and strength,
Dialogue: 4,0:17:11.38,0:17:14.10,Caption,,0,0,0,,a very present help in trouble.
Dialogue: 4,0:17:14.10,0:17:16.02,Caption,,0,0,0,,Therefore will not we fear,
Dialogue: 4,0:17:16.02,0:17:18.01,Caption,,0,0,0,,though the earth be removed,
Dialogue: 4,0:17:18.01,0:17:20.51,Caption,,0,0,0,,and though the mountains be carried
Dialogue: 4,0:17:20.51,0:17:22.54,Caption,,0,0,0,,into the midst of the sea;
Dialogue: 4,0:17:22.54,0:17:24.19,Caption,,0,0,0,,Though the waters thereof
Dialogue: 4,0:17:24.19,0:17:25.58,Caption,,0,0,0,,roar and be troubled,
Dialogue: 4,0:17:25.58,0:17:27.30,Caption,,0,0,0,,though the mountains shake
Dialogue: 4,0:17:27.30,0:17:29.20,Caption,,0,0,0,,with the swelling thereof.
Dialogue: 4,0:17:29.20,0:17:29.95,Caption,,0,0,0,,Be still,
Dialogue: 4,0:17:29.95,0:17:32.05,Caption,,0,0,0,,and know that I am God:
Dialogue: 4,0:17:32.05,0:17:34.86,Caption,,0,0,0,,I will be exalted among the heathen,
Dialogue: 4,0:17:34.86,0:17:37.46,Caption,,0,0,0,,I will be exalted in the earth.
Dialogue: 5,0:17:37.46,0:17:39.98,Verse,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,470)}The LORD of hosts is with us;
Dialogue: 4,0:17:39.98,0:17:43.25,Caption,,0,0,0,,the God of Jacob is our refuge.
Dialogue: 4,0:17:44.28,0:17:46.88,Caption,,0,0,0,,The Lord of hosts is with us.
Dialogue: 4,0:17:46.88,0:17:49.63,Caption,,0,0,0,,Even when the body feels fragile
Dialogue: 4,0:17:49.63,0:17:51.79,Caption,,0,0,0,,and the future uncertain,
Dialogue: 4,0:17:51.79,0:17:53.77,Caption,,0,0,0,,the God of angel armies
Dialogue: 4,0:17:53.77,0:17:55.59,Caption,,0,0,0,,is beside your bed.
Dialogue: 4,0:17:55.59,0:17:56.92,Caption,,0,0,0,,Be still.
Dialogue: 4,0:17:56.92,0:17:57.81,Caption,,0,0,0,,He is God,
Dialogue: 4,0:17:57.81,0:17:59.68,Caption,,0,0,0,,and you can rest.
Dialogue: 4,0:18:00.71,0:18:02.66,Caption,,0,0,0,,Breathe in slowly.
Dialogue: 4,0:18:02.66,0:18:04.40,Caption,,0,0,0,,And let it go.
Dialogue: 4,0:18:04.40,0:18:06.50,Caption,,0,0,0,,Rest in the quiet.
Dialogue: 5,0:18:08.33,0:18:10.53,Verse,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,470)}But now thus saith the LORD
Dialogue: 5,0:18:10.53,0:18:12.00,Verse,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,470)}that created thee,
Dialogue: 5,0:18:12.00,0:18:12.65,Verse,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,470)}O Jacob,
Dialogue: 5,0:18:12.65,0:18:14.61,Verse,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,470)}and he that formed thee,
Dialogue: 5,0:18:14.61,0:18:16.34,Verse,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,470)}O Israel, Fear not:
Dialogue: 5,0:18:16.34,0:18:18.27,Verse,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,470)}for I have redeemed thee,
Dialogue: 5,0:18:18.27,0:18:20.85,Verse,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,470)}I have called thee by thy name;
Dialogue: 5,0:18:20.85,0:18:22.67,Verse,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,470)}thou art mine.
Dialogue: 5,0:18:22.67,0:18:25.34,Verse,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,470)}When thou passest through the waters,
Dialogue: 5,0:18:25.34,0:18:26.97,Verse,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,470)}I will be with thee;
Dialogue: 5,0:18:26.97,0:18:28.59,Verse,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,470)}and through the rivers,
Dialogue: 5,0:18:28.59,0:18:30.82,Verse,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,470)}they shall not overflow thee:
Dialogue: 5,0:18:30.82,0:18:33.42,Verse,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,470)}when thou walkest through the fire,
Dialogue: 5,0:18:33.42,0:18:35.46,Verse,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,470)}thou shalt not be burned;
Dialogue: 5,0:18:35.46,0:18:37.31,Verse,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,470)}neither shall the flame
Dialogue: 5,0:18:37.31,0:18:39.03,Verse,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,470)}kindle upon thee.
Dialogue: 4,0:18:40.06,0:18:42.69,Caption,,0,0,0,,When thou passest through the waters,
Dialogue: 4,0:18:42.69,0:18:44.29,Caption,,0,0,0,,I will be with thee.
Dialogue: 4,0:18:44.29,0:18:47.18,Caption,,0,0,0,,Illness can feel like deep water.
Dialogue: 4,0:18:47.18,0:18:48.88,Caption,,0,0,0,,But God does not watch
Dialogue: 4,0:18:48.88,0:18:50.22,Caption,,0,0,0,,from the shore.
Dialogue: 4,0:18:50.22,0:18:52.32,Caption,,0,0,0,,He walks through it with you.
Dialogue: 4,0:18:52.32,0:18:53.95,Caption,,0,0,0,,You are his.
Dialogue: 4,0:18:53.95,0:18:56.05,Caption,,0,0,0,,He knows your name.
Dialogue: 4,0:18:57.08,0:18:59.63,Caption,,0,0,0,,For which cause we faint not;
Dialogue: 4,0:18:59.63,0:19:02.37,Caption,,0,0,0,,but though our outward man perish,
Dialogue: 4,0:19:02.37,0:19:03.82,Caption,,0,0,0,,yet the inward man
Dialogue: 4,0:19:03.82,0:19:05.78,Caption,,0,0,0,,is renewed day by day.
Dialogue: 4,0:19:05.78,0:19:07.71,Caption,,0,0,0,,For our light affliction,
Dialogue: 4,0:19:07.71,0:19:09.72,Caption,,0,0,0,,which is but for a moment,
Dialogue: 4,0:19:09.72,0:19:12.43,Caption,,0,0,0,,worketh for us a far more exceeding
Dialogue: 4,0:19:12.43,0:19:14.77,Caption,,0,0,0,,and eternal weight of glory;
Dialogue: 4,0:19:14.77,0:19:16.92,Caption,,0,0,0,,While we look not at the things
Dialogue: 4,0:19:16.92,0:19:17.95,Caption,,0,0,0,,which are seen,
Dialogue: 4,0:19:17.95,0:19:19.13,Caption,,0,0,0,,but at the things
Dialogue: 4,0:19:19.13,0:19:20.62,Caption,,0,0,0,,which are not seen:
Dialogue: 4,0:19:20.62,0:19:22.06,Caption,,0,0,0,,for the things which
Dialogue: 4,0:19:22.06,0:19:23.81,Caption,,0,0,0,,are seen are temporal;
Dialogue: 4,0:19:23.81,0:19:25.34,Caption,,0,0,0,,but the things which
Dialogue: 4,0:19:25.34,0:19:27.60,Caption,,0,0,0,,are not seen are eternal.
Dialogue: 4,0:19:28.63,0:19:31.64,Caption,,0,0,0,,The things which are seen are temporal.
Dialogue: 4,0:19:31.64,0:19:34.33,Caption,,0,0,0,,The pain you feel tonight is real,
Dialogue: 4,0:19:34.33,0:19:36.69,Caption,,0,0,0,,but it is not the whole story,
Dialogue: 4,0:19:36.69,0:19:38.61,Caption,,0,0,0,,and it is not forever.
Dialogue: 4,0:19:38.61,0:19:39.45,Caption,,0,0,0,,Beneath it,
Dialogue: 4,0:19:39.45,0:19:41.29,Caption,,0,0,0,,God is renewing the part
Dialogue: 4,0:19:41.29,0:19:43.01,Caption,,0,0,0,,of you that lasts.
Dialogue: 5,0:19:44.04,0:19:45.10,Verse,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,470)}I had fainted,
Dialogue: 5,0:19:45.10,0:19:47.20,Verse,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,470)}unless I had believed to see
Dialogue: 5,0:19:47.20,0:19:49.00,Verse,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,470)}the goodness of the LORD
Dialogue: 5,0:19:49.00,0:19:51.14,Verse,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,470)}in the land of the living.
Dialogue: 5,0:19:51.14,0:19:53.11,Verse,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,470)}Wait on the LORD:
Dialogue: 5,0:19:53.11,0:19:54.46,Verse,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,470)}be of good courage,
Dialogue: 5,0:19:54.46,0:19:57.21,Verse,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,470)}and he shall strengthen thine heart:
Dialogue: 5,0:19:57.21,0:19:59.67,Verse,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,470)}wait, I say, on the LORD.
Dialogue: 4,0:20:00.70,0:20:02.91,Caption,,0,0,0,,To see the goodness of the Lord
Dialogue: 4,0:20:02.91,0:20:04.94,Caption,,0,0,0,,in the land of the living.
Dialogue: 4,0:20:04.94,0:20:07.07,Caption,,0,0,0,,Not only someday, but here,
Dialogue: 4,0:20:07.07,0:20:08.10,Caption,,0,0,0,,in this life,
Dialogue: 4,0:20:08.10,0:20:09.70,Caption,,0,0,0,,in the days ahead.
Dialogue: 4,0:20:09.70,0:20:11.58,Caption,,0,0,0,,Wait on the Lord tonight,
Dialogue: 4,0:20:11.58,0:20:13.49,Caption,,0,0,0,,and be of good courage.
Dialogue: 4,0:20:13.49,0:20:16.04,Caption,,0,0,0,,He will strengthen your heart.
Dialogue: 5,0:20:17.07,0:20:18.46,Verse,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,470)}I sought the LORD,
Dialogue: 5,0:20:18.46,0:20:19.70,Verse,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,470)}and he heard me,
Dialogue: 5,0:20:19.70,0:20:22.58,Verse,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,470)}and delivered me from all my fears.
Dialogue: 5,0:20:22.58,0:20:23.79,Verse,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,470)}O taste and see
Dialogue: 5,0:20:23.79,0:20:25.75,Verse,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,470)}that the LORD is good:
Dialogue: 5,0:20:25.75,0:20:27.10,Verse,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,470)}blessed is the man
Dialogue: 5,0:20:27.10,0:20:28.85,Verse,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,470)}that trusteth in him.
Dialogue: 5,0:20:28.85,0:20:30.82,Verse,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,470)}The LORD is nigh unto them
Dialogue: 5,0:20:30.82,0:20:33.04,Verse,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,470)}that are of a broken heart;
Dialogue: 4,0:20:33.04,0:20:34.58,Caption,,0,0,0,,and saveth such as
Dialogue: 4,0:20:34.58,0:20:36.97,Caption,,0,0,0,,be of a contrite spirit.
Dialogue: 4,0:20:38.00,0:20:40.01,Caption,,0,0,0,,The Lord is nigh unto them
Dialogue: 4,0:20:40.01,0:20:42.28,Caption,,0,0,0,,that are of a broken heart.
Dialogue: 4,0:20:42.28,0:20:44.90,Caption,,0,0,0,,If your heart is broken tonight,
Dialogue: 4,0:20:44.90,0:20:47.13,Caption,,0,0,0,,you are not far from God.
Dialogue: 4,0:20:47.13,0:20:50.43,Caption,,0,0,0,,You are exactly where he comes closest.
Dialogue: 4,0:20:51.46,0:20:54.39,Caption,,0,0,0,,Let your breathing slow even more.
Dialogue: 4,0:20:54.39,0:20:56.02,Caption,,0,0,0,,You are safe.
Dialogue: 4,0:20:56.02,0:20:57.33,Caption,,0,0,0,,Rest.
Dialogue: 5,0:20:59.16,0:21:00.64,Verse,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,470)}I will lift up mine
Dialogue: 5,0:21:00.64,0:21:02.21,Verse,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,470)}eyes unto the hills,
Dialogue: 5,0:21:02.21,0:21:04.50,Verse,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,470)}from whence cometh my help.
Dialogue: 5,0:21:04.50,0:21:06.61,Verse,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,470)}My help cometh from the LORD,
Dialogue: 5,0:21:06.61,0:21:08.82,Verse,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,470)}which made heaven and earth.
Dialogue: 5,0:21:08.82,0:21:10.17,Verse,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,470)}He will not suffer
Dialogue: 5,0:21:10.17,0:21:11.92,Verse,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,470)}thy foot to be moved:
Dialogue: 5,0:21:11.92,0:21:14.90,Verse,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,470)}he that keepeth thee will not slumber.
Dialogue: 5,0:21:14.90,0:21:15.40,Verse,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,470)}Behold,
Dialogue: 5,0:21:15.40,0:21:17.41,Verse,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,470)}he that keepeth Israel shall
Dialogue: 5,0:21:17.41,0:21:19.45,Verse,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,470)}neither slumber nor sleep.
Dialogue: 5,0:21:19.45,0:21:21.72,Verse,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,470)}The LORD is thy keeper:
Dialogue: 5,0:21:21.72,0:21:23.38,Verse,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,470)}the LORD is thy shade
Dialogue: 5,0:21:23.38,0:21:25.14,Verse,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,470)}upon thy right hand.
Dialogue: 5,0:21:25.14,0:21:26.16,Verse,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,470)}The sun shall
Dialogue: 5,0:21:26.16,0:21:27.87,Verse,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,470)}not smite thee by day,
Dialogue: 5,0:21:27.87,0:21:29.76,Verse,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,470)}nor the moon by night.
Dialogue: 5,0:21:29.76,0:21:31.49,Verse,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,470)}The LORD shall preserve
Dialogue: 5,0:21:31.49,0:21:33.10,Verse,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,470)}thee from all evil:
Dialogue: 5,0:21:33.10,0:21:35.69,Verse,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,470)}he shall preserve thy soul.
Dialogue: 5,0:21:35.69,0:21:37.62,Verse,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,470)}The LORD shall preserve thy
Dialogue: 5,0:21:37.62,0:21:39.34,Verse,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,470)}going out and thy coming
Dialogue: 5,0:21:39.34,0:21:41.05,Verse,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,470)}in from this time forth,
Dialogue: 5,0:21:41.05,0:21:42.97,Verse,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,470)}and even for evermore.
Dialogue: 4,0:21:44.00,0:21:46.98,Caption,,0,0,0,,He that keepeth thee will not slumber.
Dialogue: 4,0:21:46.98,0:21:49.39,Caption,,0,0,0,,Through every hour of this night,
Dialogue: 4,0:21:49.39,0:21:50.49,Caption,,0,0,0,,while you rest,
Dialogue: 4,0:21:50.49,0:21:53.24,Caption,,0,0,0,,God is awake and watching over you.
Dialogue: 4,0:21:53.24,0:21:55.04,Caption,,0,0,0,,You can let go.
Dialogue: 4,0:21:55.04,0:21:56.82,Caption,,0,0,0,,He will not.
Dialogue: 4,0:21:57.85,0:21:59.99,Caption,,0,0,0,,Be careful for nothing;
Dialogue: 5,0:21:59.99,0:22:02.02,Verse,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,470)}but in every thing by prayer
Dialogue: 5,0:22:02.02,0:22:04.76,Verse,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,470)}and supplication with thanksgiving let
Dialogue: 5,0:22:04.76,0:22:07.62,Verse,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,470)}your requests be made known unto God.
Dialogue: 5,0:22:07.62,0:22:09.20,Verse,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,470)}And the peace of God,
Dialogue: 5,0:22:09.20,0:22:11.62,Verse,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,470)}which passeth all understanding,
Dialogue: 5,0:22:11.62,0:22:13.28,Verse,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,470)}shall keep your hearts
Dialogue: 5,0:22:13.28,0:22:15.97,Verse,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,470)}and minds through Christ Jesus.
Dialogue: 4,0:22:17.00,0:22:18.67,Caption,,0,0,0,,The peace of God shall
Dialogue: 4,0:22:18.67,0:22:20.58,Caption,,0,0,0,,keep your heart and mind,
Dialogue: 4,0:22:20.58,0:22:22.66,Caption,,0,0,0,,like a guard at the door.
Dialogue: 4,0:22:22.66,0:22:24.92,Caption,,0,0,0,,Whatever news tomorrow brings,
Dialogue: 4,0:22:24.92,0:22:26.27,Caption,,0,0,0,,tonight that peace
Dialogue: 4,0:22:26.27,0:22:28.28,Caption,,0,0,0,,stands watch over you.
Dialogue: 5,0:22:29.31,0:22:32.16,Verse,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,470)}Thou wilt keep him in perfect peace,
Dialogue: 5,0:22:32.16,0:22:34.63,Verse,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,470)}whose mind is stayed on thee:
Dialogue: 5,0:22:34.63,0:22:37.01,Verse,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,470)}because he trusteth in thee.
Dialogue: 5,0:22:37.01,0:22:39.53,Verse,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,470)}Trust ye in the LORD for ever:
Dialogue: 5,0:22:39.53,0:22:41.44,Verse,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,470)}for in the LORD JEHOVAH
Dialogue: 5,0:22:41.44,0:22:43.79,Verse,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,470)}is everlasting strength.
Dialogue: 4,0:22:44.82,0:22:46.62,Caption,,0,0,0,,Perfect peace for a mind
Dialogue: 4,0:22:46.62,0:22:47.86,Caption,,0,0,0,,stayed on him.
Dialogue: 4,0:22:47.86,0:22:49.83,Caption,,0,0,0,,As you drift toward sleep,
Dialogue: 4,0:22:49.83,0:22:52.41,Caption,,0,0,0,,let your last thought rest on God,
Dialogue: 4,0:22:52.41,0:22:54.46,Caption,,0,0,0,,his kindness, his nearness,
Dialogue: 4,0:22:54.46,0:22:55.63,Caption,,0,0,0,,his strength.
Dialogue: 4,0:22:55.63,0:22:57.71,Caption,,0,0,0,,Everlasting strength.
Dialogue: 4,0:22:57.71,0:22:59.87,Caption,,0,0,0,,It does not run out.
Dialogue: 4,0:23:00.90,0:23:03.36,Caption,,0,0,0,,He healeth the broken in heart,
Dialogue: 4,0:23:03.36,0:23:05.76,Caption,,0,0,0,,and bindeth up their wounds.
Dialogue: 4,0:23:05.76,0:23:08.73,Caption,,0,0,0,,He telleth the number of the stars;
Dialogue: 4,0:23:08.73,0:23:11.60,Caption,,0,0,0,,he calleth them all by their names.
Dialogue: 4,0:23:11.60,0:23:13.12,Caption,,0,0,0,,Great is our Lord,
Dialogue: 4,0:23:13.12,0:23:14.91,Caption,,0,0,0,,and of great power:
Dialogue: 4,0:23:14.91,0:23:17.87,Caption,,0,0,0,,his understanding is infinite.
Dialogue: 4,0:23:18.90,0:23:21.06,Caption,,0,0,0,,Above your roof tonight there
Dialogue: 4,0:23:21.06,0:23:23.82,Caption,,0,0,0,,are more stars than anyone can count,
Dialogue: 4,0:23:23.82,0:23:25.23,Caption,,0,0,0,,and God calls every
Dialogue: 4,0:23:25.23,0:23:26.90,Caption,,0,0,0,,one of them by name.
Dialogue: 4,0:23:26.90,0:23:28.86,Caption,,0,0,0,,The same God is binding
Dialogue: 4,0:23:28.86,0:23:30.31,Caption,,0,0,0,,up your wounds.
Dialogue: 4,0:23:30.31,0:23:32.08,Caption,,0,0,0,,Nothing about you is too
Dialogue: 4,0:23:32.08,0:23:33.48,Caption,,0,0,0,,small for his care,
Dialogue: 4,0:23:33.48,0:23:35.48,Caption,,0,0,0,,and nothing about your pain
Dialogue: 4,0:23:35.48,0:23:37.68,Caption,,0,0,0,,is too big for his power.
Dialogue: 5,0:23:38.70,0:23:40.24,Verse,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,470)}But thou, O LORD,
Dialogue: 5,0:23:40.24,0:23:42.24,Verse,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,470)}art a shield for me;
Dialogue: 5,0:23:42.24,0:23:42.94,Verse,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,470)}my glory,
Dialogue: 5,0:23:42.94,0:23:45.55,Verse,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,470)}and the lifter up of mine head.
Dialogue: 5,0:23:45.55,0:23:47.25,Verse,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,470)}I cried unto the LORD
Dialogue: 5,0:23:47.25,0:23:48.38,Verse,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,470)}with my voice,
Dialogue: 5,0:23:48.38,0:23:49.92,Verse,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,470)}and he heard me out
Dialogue: 5,0:23:49.92,0:23:51.47,Verse,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,470)}of his holy hill.
Dialogue: 5,0:23:51.47,0:23:53.98,Verse,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,470)}I laid me down and slept;
Dialogue: 5,0:23:53.98,0:23:55.52,Verse,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,470)}I awaked;
Dialogue: 5,0:23:55.52,0:23:58.07,Verse,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,470)}for the LORD sustained me.
Dialogue: 4,0:23:59.10,0:24:01.52,Caption,,0,0,0,,The lifter up of mine head.
Dialogue: 4,0:24:01.52,0:24:03.34,Caption,,0,0,0,,When illness or sorrow
Dialogue: 4,0:24:03.34,0:24:04.91,Caption,,0,0,0,,bows your head low,
Dialogue: 4,0:24:04.91,0:24:07.24,Caption,,0,0,0,,God gently lifts it again.
Dialogue: 4,0:24:07.24,0:24:09.41,Caption,,0,0,0,,Lay your head down now.
Dialogue: 4,0:24:09.41,0:24:10.76,Caption,,0,0,0,,He will lift it up
Dialogue: 4,0:24:10.76,0:24:12.23,Caption,,0,0,0,,in the morning.
Dialogue: 5,0:24:13.26,0:24:15.43,Verse,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,470)}He that dwelleth in the secret
Dialogue: 5,0:24:15.43,0:24:17.88,Verse,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,470)}place of the most High shall abide
Dialogue: 5,0:24:17.88,0:24:20.44,Verse,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,470)}under the shadow of the Almighty.
Dialogue: 5,0:24:20.44,0:24:22.37,Verse,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,470)}I will say of the LORD,
Dialogue: 5,0:24:22.37,0:24:25.23,Verse,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,470)}He is my refuge and my fortress:
Dialogue: 5,0:24:25.23,0:24:26.71,Verse,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,470)}my God;
Dialogue: 5,0:24:26.71,0:24:28.87,Verse,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,470)}in him will I trust.
Dialogue: 5,0:24:28.87,0:24:31.53,Verse,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,470)}He shall cover thee with his feathers,
Dialogue: 5,0:24:31.53,0:24:34.30,Verse,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,470)}and under his wings shalt thou trust:
Dialogue: 5,0:24:34.30,0:24:35.93,Verse,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,470)}his truth shall be thy
Dialogue: 5,0:24:35.93,0:24:37.51,Verse,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,470)}shield and buckler.
Dialogue: 5,0:24:37.51,0:24:40.11,Verse,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,470)}Because thou hast made the LORD,
Dialogue: 5,0:24:40.11,0:24:41.66,Verse,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,470)}which is my refuge,
Dialogue: 5,0:24:41.66,0:24:43.20,Verse,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,470)}even the most High,
Dialogue: 5,0:24:43.20,0:24:44.60,Verse,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,470)}thy habitation;
Dialogue: 5,0:24:44.60,0:24:46.95,Verse,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,470)}There shall no evil befall thee,
Dialogue: 5,0:24:46.95,0:24:48.72,Verse,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,470)}neither shall any plague
Dialogue: 5,0:24:48.72,0:24:50.58,Verse,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,470)}come nigh thy dwelling.
Dialogue: 5,0:24:50.58,0:24:52.72,Verse,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,470)}For he shall give his angels
Dialogue: 5,0:24:52.72,0:24:54.01,Verse,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,470)}charge over thee,
Dialogue: 5,0:24:54.01,0:24:56.57,Verse,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,470)}to keep thee in all thy ways.
Dialogue: 4,0:24:57.60,0:24:59.37,Caption,,0,0,0,,Lord, as sleep comes,
Dialogue: 4,0:24:59.37,0:25:00.97,Caption,,0,0,0,,I give you my body,
Dialogue: 4,0:25:00.97,0:25:02.92,Caption,,0,0,0,,my heart and my mind.
Dialogue: 4,0:25:02.92,0:25:05.15,Caption,,0,0,0,,Heal what needs healing.
Dialogue: 4,0:25:05.15,0:25:07.50,Caption,,0,0,0,,Comfort what needs comfort.
Dialogue: 4,0:25:07.50,0:25:09.61,Caption,,0,0,0,,Watch over me through the night,
Dialogue: 4,0:25:09.61,0:25:11.53,Caption,,0,0,0,,and let me wake to your mercy
Dialogue: 4,0:25:11.53,0:25:12.87,Caption,,0,0,0,,in the morning.
Dialogue: 4,0:25:13.90,0:25:15.40,Caption,,0,0,0,,And now receive this
Dialogue: 4,0:25:15.40,0:25:17.23,Caption,,0,0,0,,blessing as you sleep.
Dialogue: 5,0:25:17.23,0:25:17.88,Verse,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,470)}Beloved,
Dialogue: 5,0:25:17.88,0:25:20.52,Verse,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,470)}I wish above all things that thou
Dialogue: 5,0:25:20.52,0:25:23.09,Verse,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,470)}mayest prosper and be in health,
Dialogue: 5,0:25:23.09,0:25:25.52,Verse,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,470)}even as thy soul prospereth.
Dialogue: 4,0:25:25.52,0:25:27.66,Caption,,0,0,0,,Rest in his care tonight.
Dialogue: 4,0:25:27.66,0:25:30.47,Caption,,0,0,0,,In Jesus' name, amen.
